    <dashboard name='地区_销售经理_利润情况' type='storyboard'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='673' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98690' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99304' x='348' y='655'>
            <zone h='3440' id='3' type-v2='title' w='99304' x='348' y='655' />
            <zone h='8272' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='99304' x='348' y='4095' />
            <zone h='86978' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='99304' x='348' y='12367'>
              <flipboard active-id='3' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='通过观察各省份情况，对比两年的盈利情况，辽宁、内蒙古、江苏、浙江、湖北、四川、甘肃这几个省份亏损较大' captured-sheet='销售经理_利润地图' id='1'>
                    <capturedDeltas>
                      <worksheet name='利润_年度对比'>
                        <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.142s88q1jwmcsg1cmau831ojhmvj].[Action (省/自治区)]'>
                          <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[省/自治区]' user:ui-enumeration='all' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
                        </filter>
                        <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.142s88q1jwmcsg1cmau831ojhmvj].[Action (销售经理)]'>
                          <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[销售经理]' user:ui-enumeration='all' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
                        </filter>
                      </worksheet>
                      <worksheet name='折扣利润情况'>
                        <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.142s88q1jwmcsg1cmau831ojhmvj].[Action (销售经理)]'>
                          <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[销售经理]' user:ui-enumeration='all' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
                        </filter>
                      </worksheet>
                      <worksheet name='省份利润地图'>
                        <style delta-type='added'>
                          <style-rule element='axis'>
                            <encoding attr='space' class='0' field='[federated.142s88q1jwmcsg1cmau831ojhmvj].[Latitude (generated)]' field-type='quantitative' max='8121036.2675004434' min='-231750.02461788672' projection='EPSG:3857' range-type='fixed' scope='rows' type='space' />
                            <encoding attr='space' class='0' field='[federated.142s88q1jwmcsg1cmau831ojhmvj].[Longitude (generated)]' field-type='quantitative' max='15278085.284174576' min='7623951.7508528493' projection='EPSG:3857' range-type='fixed' scope='cols' type='space' />
                          </style-rule>
                        </style>
                      </worksheet>
                      <worksheet name='销售经理利润分布散点图'>
                        <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.142s88q1jwmcsg1cmau831ojhmvj].[Action (销售经理)]'>
                          <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[销售经理]' user:ui-enumeration='all' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
                        </filter>
                      </worksheet>
                    </capturedDeltas>
                  </story-point>
                  <story-point caption='通过对比销售额和利润在各地区的分布情况，华北和中南地区毛利率高于平均水平，华东和和西北地区接近平均水平，而东北和西南地区则远低于平均水平，而东北和西南地区又有不小的市场体量' captured-sheet='地区_利润组合' id='3' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='13104' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='12059' x='37135' y='77068'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>这些亏损省份都是因为折扣订单过多且折扣量大导致亏损，0.4折扣以上订单占比均超过70%</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='12776' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='10405' x='89334' y='63882'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>观察利润销售额散点分布情况同样发现，这些亏损省份盈利订单很少，多为亏损订单</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='15152' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='12016' x='79539' y='1966'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>每一位销售经理所负责的区域都有亏损的省份，对比两年的利润情况，郝杰、杨洪光、张怡莲的利润有较明显的下滑波动</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{3A9319F4-3C82-468E-84D4-EE12BDBC5841}' />
    </dashboard>
